            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var title=\"Project Financial Control\";\nvar description=\"Help Topic\";\nvar message=\"I can help manage the financial lifecycle of projects by keeping project costs, billing, assets, invoices, and accounting reconciliations on track. I can provide inquiry support, exception guidance, reconciliation help, and route project financial questions to the right specialist area.\";\nvar q=String($context.$system.$currentDateTime||\"\"),\nts=q?q.slice(8,10)+\"-\"+q.slice(5,7)+\"-\"+q.slice(0,4)+\" \"+q.slice(11,16):String($context.$system.$currentDate||\"\"),\no={\n  agent:($context.$workflow&&$context.$workflow.$code)||\"ORA_PRJ_PROJECT_FINANCIAL_CONTROL_AGENT\",\n  intent:\"help_topic\",\n  schema_version:\"1\",\n  title:title,\n  description:description,\n  timestamp:ts,\n  agent_response:[\n    {\n      display_type:\"text\",\n      display_sequence:1,\n      text:message\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\nreturn {\n  activeContext:\"PFCA\",\n  message:message,\n  wrappedResponse:JSON.stringify(o)\n};"
